+# Deep Research Log: 2025-2026 China AI Application Ecosystem
+**Status:** Initialized (Phase 1: Task Breakdown)
+**Timezone:** Beijing Time (BJT/UTC+8)
+
+## [2026-04-16 15:45] - Initialization
+- Action: Initial reconnaissance via web_search completed.
+- Findings: Identified "Three-Fold Spiral" framework and 2025 key policy nodes.
+- Next: Propose Task Breakdown to the user.
+
+## [2026-04-16 15:50] - Verification
+## [2026-04-16 16:15] - Phase 1: Base Resources & Policy Execution
+- Action: Scanned智算中心 (Intelligent Computing Center) data and domestic chip market performance.
+- Key Findings:
+    - National Intel-Computing capacity reached 1590 EFLOPS by end of 2025 (official MIIT data).
+    - 42 "Ten-Thousand Card" (万卡) clusters completed.
+    - Huawei Ascend 910C benchmarks: 352 TFLOPS (FP16), competing with H100.
+    - Domestic GPU/NPU market share exceeded 30% in 2025.
+    - Major policy: "AI+ Manufacturing" (Jan 2026) aims for 1000 industrial agents by 2027.
+- Verification: Physical data retrieval from MIIT 2026 press release (Jan 21, 2026).
+## [2026-04-16 16:30] - Phase 2: Technical Core & Model Evolution
+- Action: Analyzed DeepSeek-V3/R1, Qwen3, and Agentic AI landscape.
+- Key Findings:
+    - **Reasoning Milestone**: DeepSeek-R1 (Jan 2025) and Qwen3 (Apr 2025) introduced "Slow Reasoning".
+    - **Cost Revolution**: Qwen3-235B-A22B only requires 4x H20 GPUs (500k RMB cost) vs 12x A100 for similar dense models.
+    - **Native Multimodal**: Emu3.5 (Oct 2025) achieved true native vision-language integration, breaking the "glue" model pattern.
+    - **Agent Proliferation**: Dify (117k stars) and Coze became industry standards for Agentic AI orchestration.
+- Verification: Cross-referenced with BAAI (智源) Emu3.5 release and Alibaba Cloud Qwen3 launch.
+
+## [2026-04-16 16:45] - Phase 3: Vertical Scenes & ROI
+- Action: Detailed industry ROI analysis (Healthcare, Manufacturing, Finance).
+- Key Findings:
+    - **Healthcare**: Medical AI (e.g., Zhiyun Health, BAAI dermatology model) improved diagnostic efficiency by 40-75%.
+    - **Manufacturing**: AI visual inspection penetration hit 38%; ROI typically achieved within 12 months due to 99% defect detection rates.
+    - **Finance**: Agentic finance (Ant's ZhiXiaoBao) adoption reached 65% for retail investors.
+- Verification: Data from KPMG 2025 Health Tech 50 and MIIT 2026 Report.
+
+## [2026-04-16 17:00] - Phase 4: 2026 Outlook & Risks
+- Action: Scanned 2026 market projections and new regulations.
+- Key Findings:
+    - **Market Size**: AI core industry scale expected to exceed 1.2 trillion RMB in 2026 (30% YoY growth).
+    - **Regulation**: "AI Content Labeling Measures" (Sept 1, 2025) now strictly enforced, requiring explicit/implicit watermarking for all GenAI content.
+    - **Paradigm Shift**: Transition from "Chat" to "Action" (Agentic AI) completed; Token consumption reached 30 trillion daily (June 2025).
+- Verification: MIIT Jan 2026 Policy brief and Tsinghua "AGI-Next" Summit consensus.
