Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Private scope without user_context → REFUSE (prevent leak to global)
- Public scope without shared=True → REFUSE (prevent accidental global write)
- _sanitize_lesson_text() masks chat_id/token/long IDs in preview
- user_id from runtime metadata only, never from lesson text
- 8 new security tests (61 total)
